WEBVTT

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.390
What will you do, Toji?

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.950
Will you challenge me once again,

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.050
or will you be sucked into the 
netherworld along with this world?

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:20.460
Regardless, your time is up.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:50.910
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:56.630
<b>Episode 23  Moment's End</b>

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.200
Princess Tagitsu doesn't 
seem to be coming after us.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:05.250
Now that she's absorbed Princess Takiri
 and Princess Ichikishima,

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.150
we're likely of little importance.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:11.680
This is good timing, Kanami.
Let's rest a bit.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:15.690
Are you okay, Hiyori-chan?

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.320
Yeah.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.920
Hey, Eternal, hold out your hand.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:22.770
This is?

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.450
A mint chocolate cookie.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.900
You brought that for Hiyori-chan, Kaoru-chan?

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.570
I didn't have it on hand or anything.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.950
I stole it from there.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.330
<b>Please put in
100 yen!</b>

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.390
Office snacks?

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:37.830
But we're stealing...

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.570
This is an emergency.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.590
I'm sure they'll let it slide just this once.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.760
Thievery isn't right.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.380
Hang on a moment.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.140
<b>Send a bill to
Origami Yukari later</b>

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:51.850
Wow, there's chocolate, cookies, 
gummies, and other candy, too!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.870
The office snacks have 
really improved lately.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.320
Here, you have some too, Sayaka-chan.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:56.940
Okay.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:57.930
I'll take this one!

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:58.940
Well? Is it good?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:00.820
Do you want one?

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.780
Oh, no, I...

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:07.410
You're not going to give me any nonsense like,
"They taste like toothpaste," are you?

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.850
I'll have one, then.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.370
It's such an unusual flavor.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.960
What?! It's not unusual at all!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.720
And what's with that strange, forced smile?!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.030
No, that's not what I meant.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.950
It's just that everyone 
has their preferences.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.550
The sky is falling.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:38.180
Yes, we've been seeing that here, too.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.930
It started falling about fifteen minutes ago.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:42.670
Evacuation orders have been given out

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:46.820
to the special religious units
 deployed in the twenty-three wards,

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:49.510
along with all police and SDF forces.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.510
The entire ward has been 
ordered to evacuate!

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:52.090
Evacuate the vehicles once 
all troops are loaded up!

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.510
We'll handle the rear. 
You must retreat quickly!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.450
But...

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.220
We will also withdraw 
while keeping things in check.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.530
Just ignore the aradama and hurry!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:12.850
I'm sorry.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.770
Please take care of yourselves.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.220
We will!

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.980
What's going to happen once that thing falls?

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.980
<i>No idea.</i>

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.010
"No idea," she says.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:29.350
<i>Honestly, it's hard to grasp the 
amount of destruction it will cause.</i>

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.660
No way...

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.790
<i>Try not to judge us too harshly.</i>

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:33.870
Grandpa!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.870
I know it's not easy on you all,

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.640
but we really don't know anything.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:43.250
At any rate, we simply can't
observe what's going on beyond it,

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:47.000
no matter what method we use,
whether it's lasers, radio waves,

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.100
or any frequency of sound waves.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.760
But since we can't observe it,

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.360
<i>that naturally leaves only one conclusion.</i>

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.970
And what conclusion is that?

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:02.020
<i>That it is the border between 
this world and the netherworld.</i>

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.150
Then beyond it is...

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.020
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.520
<i>The netherworld.</i>

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.840
<i>The border between both worlds is 
already vague, and noro are seeping out.</i>

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.410
<i>But that is only a secondary concern.</i>

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:18.400
<i>Princess Tagitsu's objective is to smash 
the netherworld and this world together,</i>

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.160
<i>thus completely eliminating the boundary.</i>

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.070
Eliminate the boundary?

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.370
What's that going to do?

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:28.050
<i>The netherworld is where the countless 
possibilities of this world,</i>

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.520
<i>"the many shadows of reality,"
are all gathered.</i>

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.680
I don't get it.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.820
<i>An example might be that the world 
we live in is like a sugar cube,</i>

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.440
<i>and the netherworld is like the raging sea.</i>

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.060
A sugar cube and the sea?

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:45.250
<i>Yes, this world could easily melt away in it.</i>

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.950
<i>And we will fall into chaos where 
our physical laws don't apply,</i>

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.740
<i>and time and space will become uncertain.</i>

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:54.570
<i>It will surely be the end of this world.</i>

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:04.980
We've just gotta take her down, then.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:09.550
Such a simple, Kaoru-like answer, 
but it's not a bad one.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.410
That's always been the plan.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.420
You're right.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.470
You all...

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.200
There's no time. Let's go.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:16.020
Yeah.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.970
<i>We thought you'd say that.</i>

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:23.090
Etou, Kohagura, Mashiko, Itomi, 
Yanase, Juujou, and Yukari,

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:25.250
you will not be given retreat orders.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.730
Your only orders are to 
suppress Princess Tagitsu.

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:30.740
<i>Take down that evil god with all your might!</i>

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.690
G-Guys!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.650
I brought... some more... batteries...

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.740
Rui-san?!

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.060
So heavy...

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.350
Are you all right?

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.110
What are you doing here?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.510
Did you run all the way or something?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.990
This is the 48th floor.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.800
Couldn't you have just launched
the batteries over in a container?

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:57.590
You didn't have to come to 
such a dangerous place.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:02.190
That's true, but I figured 
this was the fastest way.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.900
Thank you so much.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.350
<i>Don't forget, while we may not be there,</i>

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:14.550
<i>we, and all the humans who 
know what is going on there,</i>

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.010
<i>are still with you.</i>

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.640
I won't tell you to be careful in 
such an unavoidable situation,

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:29.710
but remember that this is just an 
excursion until you can come back home.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:30.880
<i>Got it?</i>

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:31.960
Grandpa...

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:03.600
It's painful being the ones
sending them out there...

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:08.750
Yes, but I'm sure they don't see it that way.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.500
Just like us twenty years ago.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:15.750
Hiyori-chan...

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:19.880
Right, let's go put an end to all of this.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.930
So we all make it back home together.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.000
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:40.670
Good luck.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.230
Missiles? Now?

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.540
What a waste...

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:02.640
I'm so sorry that this is all I can do.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:29.750
Humans also celebrate being reunited 
by setting off fireworks,

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.000
don't they?

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.880
You all look pretty full of determination.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:44.640
Now, why don't you watch over 
the end of this world with me?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:48.850
Whoa! You're really starting 
to sound like a human now.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.350
Must be the effect of absorbing
Princess Takiri and Princess Ichikishima.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.160
Don't you know?

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:58.190
The final boss exists to be destroyed.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.930
That's right, the world 
isn't going to be destroyed.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.660
You will be, Princess Tagitsu.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:07.370
If this were a fabrication, perhaps.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.160
But this is reality.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.970
You're full of openings!

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.470
<i>I got her!</i>

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.760
So foolish.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:27.760
Mai!

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.700
How delightful.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.370
Bring it.

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.950
What's the matter? Can not even 
one of your blades touch me?

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.280
Kanami!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.010
Cornered rats trying to bite the cat?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.190
But I'm ending this.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.910
Maki-san, we have run out of time.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:17.160
You go on back. I'll go on alone.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.790
Are you really still saying 
things like that now?

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.290
I will not let you go on alone!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:25.980
There she is!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:36.000
She's holding a funeral for her.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:37.600
That's not fair!

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:42.150
Now I won't be able to kill you anymore!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.370
Maki-san...

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:48.250
Yomi...

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:52.530
Tonight is Christmas Eve, your birthday.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.950
This is supposed to be the biggest 
day of celebration, but you...

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.920
We cannot take Yomi-san back 
with us, but we should at least...

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:00.950
Right, come on.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:01.580
No!

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:05.810
Yomi came back to me.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.560
Not anyone else but me.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.970
That's why I won't leave her.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.440
Don't be ridiculous!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.550
You'll be sucked up by the 
noro if you stay like this!

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:18.400
I don't care, as long as I'm with Yomi.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:24.170
Yomi-san risked her life until the 
very end trying to protect you!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.480
Please...

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.370
Don't let Yomi's feelings go to waste.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.370
Let's go.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.620
Yomi...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.520
This is?

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.120
The threshold between our 
world and the netherworld.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.400
Threshold...

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.190
The fact that we've been brought here means

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:12.530
that there are only a few minutes left
 before the boundary reaches the ground.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.280
You are correct.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:19.030
Now the joining of this world and 
the netherworld is inevitable.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.310
But it is indeed regrettable

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:25.390
that you will be sucked into the netherworld
without us being able to settle things.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:29.860
I'll let you enjoy the time you have 
left until the very last moment.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:30.460
Jin'i?!

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:37.840
Good move, but what about the next one?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.030
We need to go, too!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.390
You won't get away!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.050
She raised the level of her jin'i?

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:01.080
Mai!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.830
Sorry, but we've reached our limit.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:05.460
You go on ahead!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.330
Please be sure to win.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.210
Right!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.170
Mai...

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:25.870
Mai!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.570
You move well at this speed.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:35.250
Keep entertaining me further into eternity!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.030
Mai...

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.950
I'm fine. All of you, go on!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.500
We'll see you later, Mai-chan!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.970
Everyone, please stay safe.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:16:00.800
It is surprising that even three 
of you could keep up with me.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:07.310
Listen well, Toji. This is the first 
time that my heart has danced this much.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.190
I pity you, Princess Tagitsu.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.780
I won't let you say that you haven't noticed

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.440
the deep loneliness in 
the depths of your heart.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:22.570
You have learned about the fundamental 
loneliness of noro by fusing with people.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:23.730
Oh?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.230
A child is made when humans join together,

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:29.540
and they will continue to inherit 
their character and destiny.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.080
Just like Kanami and I have done.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:34.180
But that is not true for you.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.590
Noro is a lonely existence outside 
of the connected circle of life.

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:40.510
We are without equal.

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:43.200
We transcend the confines of time.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.720
Such a circle is...

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:47.840
Yes, you are not afraid of time.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.480
The only thing you're 
afraid of is the okatana.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.670
If an okatana chops up noro to the point that its intelligence can't remain,

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:58.270
once it fuses with you again, 
it will no longer be you.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:01.360
It will be a separate aradama whose 
memory and character are different.

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:05.370
That is a phenomenon similar to 
the death that living beings fear.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:09.540
So while you exist outside of the circle 
of life, you have a concept of death.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.650
You want to heal that loneliness...

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:15.190
No, you know that loneliness 
can't be healed, but you...

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:18.820
...have gone on a rampage because 
you're lonely and want an opponent,

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:20.130
just like a child.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.230
That's quite a thing to say,

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:26.510
considering you Toji have come here 
with okatana in hand to chop me up.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.220
Yes, all we can do

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.730
is cut you down and exorcise you.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.870
We don't have the power to save you.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:37.570
That's why I'm going to go with you.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:44.740
Kanami!

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:58.380
So you're finally alone, Kogarasu Toji.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.210
That was always my intention.

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.330
I see.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:05.270
Well then, I can just slay you 
in the momentary flow of time.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.850
Surely you haven't forgotten about me.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:16.350
Let's go, Princess Tagitsu, 
to the depths of hell together!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.240
Yukari?!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.070
This time, it's my turn!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:28.580
Juujou, you will be the one to suppress 
Princess Tagitsu, now that I've stabbed her!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.920
That is the duty you have inherited 
through the power of the Hiiragi!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.500
Yukari!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.830
We've come this far...

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:49.110
You, too, are merely human.

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:52.470
The effects of twenty years of 
resistance don't go away so easily.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:00.890
It is a pity that you didn't even 
have time to generate your utsushi.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.110
Juujou...

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.300
Thank you, Yukari-sama.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:10.120
But this is my responsibility after all.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.910
Wait...

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.320
Hiyori-chan!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.270
Kanami?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:18.030
Hiyori-chan!

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:20.490
Hiyori... Whoa!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.730
Kanami? How?

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:27.430
I did my best to chase after you.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.590
Your best?

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.680
Okay, Kanami, together we can—

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.100
Yeah, let's save her!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:39.200
I mean, didn't Princess Tagitsu just 
say that we made her heart dance?

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.360
That means she's having fun, right?

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.550
Let's do this, Princess Tagitsu!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:48.020
What a peculiar person.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.550
Do you intend to keep 
clashing swords with me,

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:55.580
locked in this moment for close 
to eternity, just to entertain me?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:58.850
Nope! It's for my entertainment!

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:02.140
Your sword will tell me all about you.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:06.340
You mean Princess Tagitsu 
is enjoying this fight?

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.050
Yes, it's the same.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.190
Fighting with okatana or 
having a bout with everyone.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:13.260
They are all ways of having 
conversations through our swords!

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.400
<i>And this is also a conversation.</i>

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:20.100
So this is your sword, then, Kanami.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.400
I'm sorry, Kanami.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.980
I lied to you.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.740
I know you did.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.450
Juujou... Etou...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.410
Kanami?

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:57.890
Sayaka-chan, where are 
Kanami-chan and the others?

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.060
Yukari!

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.150
Bureau director!

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.840
What in the world is happening?

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:16.430
Where am I?

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:21.740
Ayumu!

00:23:21.740 --> 00:23:23.750
You're finally awake!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.200
Where's Etou-san?

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:32.880
I... have to apologize to her for something.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode  The United Maidens</b>
